    "identifier": "savage-attack",
    "description": "<p><strong>Skill:</strong> Martial Arts</p>\n<p><strong>Exploit Type:</strong> Combat Exploit</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Undertaker Subclass</p>\n<p>You channel pure brutality into a devastating strike. When you deal Lethal Attack damage, you may choose to forgo 1 or 2 Lethal Attack dice. If you forgo 1 Lethal Attack dice, the damaged creature must make a Strength saving throw, gaining 1 rank of Weakened and suffer disadvantage on their next attack roll before the beginning of your next turn on a failed save</p>\n<p>If you forgo 2 Lethal Attack dice, the damaged creature must make a Strength saving throw, being knocked prone and being unable to take reactions on a failed save.</p>",
